<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_8__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Prosecutor shall disclose to the court the intention to produce sensitive information as evidence against the accused during the trial and the court shall allow the application under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
