<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_9__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Whenever an accused learns of additional sensitive information which he reasonably expects to disclose at his trial, he shall give two days’ notice to the Public Prosecutor and the court in writing of his intention to do so and such notice shall include a brief description of the sensitive information."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_9__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
