<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_9__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "No accused shall disclose any information known or believed to be sensitive in connection with his trial until notice has been given under this section and until the court makes a decision pursuant to the procedure in section 10."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
