<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_30__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon application by the Public Prosecutor under subsection (3), the court shall commit the accused to prison pending the disposal of the appeal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_30__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_30> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
