<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_30__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon application by the Public Prosecutor under subsection (5), the court shall remand the accused in prison pending the filing of the notice of appeal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
