<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_30__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "An accused committed to prison under this section shall be held until all appeals are disposed of. Power to make regulations"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
