<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VII__cl_17> <https://schema.org/text> "This Part shall have effect notwithstanding anything inconsistent with the Evidence Act 1950 [Act 56]. Statement by any person who is dead, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
