<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VII__cl_19> <https://schema.org/text> "A conviction obtained based on the uncorroborated testimony of a child of tender years is not illegal, though not given under oath, if the court is of the opinion that the child is possessed of sufﬁ cient intelligence and understands the duty of speaking the truth. Documents seized during raid or in the course of investigation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VII__cl_20> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
