<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VII__cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "Search list of all documents and things seized during a raid shall be admissible as evidence in court to prove the existence of the documents and things seized that were not produced in court due to the nature of the documents and things. Non-production of exhibit"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
