<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VII__cl_26__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "no witness shall be regarded as an accomplice by reason only of such witness having been in any manner concerned in the commission of the security offence or having knowledge of the commission of the offence; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
