<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@/~part_VI__cl_15> <https://schema.org/text> "If in the course of taking evidence under section 14 the accused or any other person is required to be identified by the witness who gives evidence in the manner provided in that section, such identification may be made by the witness through an interpreter or other officer of the court. Protection of witness’ identity"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/eng@> .
